There&#8217;s still a little more than a year until its 90th anniversary, but Banda El Recodo de Cruz Lizárraga has already started celebrating. The greatest exponent of Sinaloan banda is kicking off its 10th European tour on Friday (Sept. 18), while its exhibition at the Grammy Museum runs concurrently.

